<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Good&nbsp;<span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);"><font color="#ff6666"><b>[morning or afternoon] [Contact Name]</b></font>,</span></span></font><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);"><br></span></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><b><font color="#ff6666" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);">&lt;FOR CLIENTS WHO ARE BEING TERMED BY INSPERITY, FOR EXAMPLE, FINANCIAL DEFAULT, DELETE THE FIRST AND LAST PARAGRAPHS. REMOVE THESE INSTRUCTIONS&gt;</font></b></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">Although we are disappointed to lose you as an Insperity client, we respect the business decision you have made for&nbsp;<b><font color="#ff6666" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);">[Client Company Name]</font></b>, and wanted to send you a personal note regarding how much we have enjoyed working with you. If there is anything that you need, please do not hesitate to contact your Insperity team. We are here to help you through the transition.</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">Please review the following items and contact us if you have any questions or need assistance during this time:</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><b>Upcoming Employee Mailings</b></div><div><ul><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;">COBRA information will be mailed to the home address on file for each employee participating in the Inspenty Group Health Plan and the Insperity Health Care FSA Plan.</span></li><li><font face="arial">W-2s will be mailed to the home address on file of each employee unless electronic delivery was previously elected. Electronic delivery will be sent to the email address designated by the employee.</font></li><li><font face="arial">Employees enrolled in the Insperity Welfare Benefits Plan (i.e., Cigna life, disability and/or personal accident insurance coverage) will receive information directly from Cigna on how to convert or port coverage, as applicable.</font></li><li><font face="arial">Please encourage your employees to update their addresses in their Insperity Premier<sup>TM</sup>&nbsp; account to expedite the correct delivery of information.</font></li></ul><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><b>Employee Access</b></span><ul><li><font face="arial">All employees may access their personal information through&nbsp;<font color="#3366ff"><a href="https://passport.insperity.com/SecureAuth15/SecureAuth.aspx?wa=wsignin1.0&wtrealm=urn%3asp.PCMS&wctx=rm%3d0%26id%3dpassive%26ru%3d%252fcs%252fnsp%252findex&wct=2022-12-19T12%3a48%3a43Z&wreply=https%3a%2f%2fportal.insperity.com%2fcs%2fnsp%2findex"> Insperity Premier</a></font>&nbsp;for 18 months following your company's Workforce Optimization end date of&nbsp;<span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);"><font color="#ff6666"><b>[ENTER DATE].</b></font></span></font></li><li><font face="arial">Refer to the attached documents labeled "Former Employee Access" and "After You Leave FAQ" for valuable information to share with your employees.&nbsp;</font></li><li><font face="arial">If employees have questions or need assistance with accessing Insperity Premier, please direct them to the Insperity Contact Center at 866-715-3552, 7 a.m. to 7 p.m. Central time, Monday to Friday.</font></li><li><font face="arial"><b><font color="#ff6666" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);">&lt;REMOVE THIS SECTION IF CLIENT DOES NOT HAVE AN INSPERITY 401(k) PRIOR TO EMAILING&gt;</font></b>&nbsp;Employees who have a 401(k) account with Insperity will continue to have access to their account beyond 18 months through the Retirement Service Center<sup>SM&nbsp;</sup>by logging in directly at retirement.insperity.com.</font></li><li><font face="arial"><font color="#ff6666"><b style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);">&lt;REMOVE THIS SECTION IF CLIENT DOES NOT HAVE AN INSPERITY 401(k) PRIOR TO EMAILING&gt;</b></font>&nbsp;If employees have questions or need assistance with accessing the Retirement Service Center<sup>SM</sup>, please direct them to the Insperity 401(k) Contact Center at 888-401-5273, 7 a.m. to 7 p.m. Central time, Monday&nbsp;</font>to Friday.</li></ul><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><b>Benefits</b></span><ul><li><font face="arial">Employees currently enrolled in the Insperity Health Care FSA Plan will have until 3/31/20<b><font color="#ff6666" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);">XX</font></b>&nbsp;to submit claims incurred during the employee's coverage period. Employees who want to continue Health Care FSA coverage after termination must elect COBRA.</font></li></ul><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><b>COBRA Fees</b></span><ul><li><font face="arial">If your company has any COBRA participants enrolled in Insperity Group Health Plan coverage as of the date of contract termination, or if any of your current employees (or their dependents) enroll in COBRA coverage under the Insperity Group Health Plan as a result of their termination of employment with Insperity, your company may be subject to additional fees relating to COBRA participation. You should review your Client Service Agreement (CSA) to determine what contractual obligations you may have, if any, regarding COBRA coverage in the event of the CSA termination. You will be contacted by&nbsp;</font>Insperity if COBRA fees are applicable to your company.</li><li><font face="arial">Insperity is legally required to offer COBRA coverage to any employee or dependent losing Insperity Group Health Plan coverage due to termination of employment, even if that employee or dependent is also eligible for group health plan coverage under a new group health plan you put in place once you l</font>eave Insperity.</li></ul><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><b>Employer Reporting</b></span><ul><li><font face="arial">Employer reporting capabilities will continue for 90 days from your contract termination date. It is recommended that you pull year-to-date reports for all customized reports you have prior to your termination date.</font></li><li><font face="arial">After the 90<sup>th</sup>&nbsp;day following your termination date, please contact me or your payroll specialist to assist you with any information you may need.</font></li></ul><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><b>Insperity 401(k) Plan&nbsp;</b></span><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);"><b><font color="#ff6666">&lt;REMOVE THIS SECTION IF CLIENT DOES NOT HAVE AN INSPERITY 401(k) PRIOR TO EMAILING&gt;</font></b></span><ul><li><font face="arial">Employees participating in the Insperity 401(k) Plan will no longer be able to contribute or make loan payments to the Insperity 401(k) Plan after your company termination date.</font></li><li><font face="arial">Employees will receive information about outstanding loans, if any, and will need to plan to pay off outstanding balances to avoid loan default and taxation.</font></li><li><font face="arial">You should contact Insperity Retirement Services at 800-242-8893, ext. 4015, to discuss your options regarding employee assets remaining in the Insperity 401(k) Plan.</font></li></ul><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><b>Insperity OrgPlus</b>&nbsp;<font color="#ff6666" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);"><b>&lt;REMOVE THIS SECTION IF CLIENT DOES NOT HAVE ORGPLUS PRIOR TO EMAILING&gt;</b></font></span><ul><li><font face="arial">A member of the Customer Success team will be reaching out to you shortly to discuss your options for extracting your data depending on your decision about the service.</font></li><li><font face="arial">You may keep your OrgPlus system independently of the Insperity Workforce Optimization relationship, and your Customer Success Specialist will be happy to answer any questions you may have related to keeping OrgPlus.</font></li></ul><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><b>Insperity Time and Attendance</b>&nbsp;<font color="#ff6666" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);"><b>&lt;REMOVE THIS SECTION IF CLIENT DOES NOT HAVE TIMESTAR PRIOR TO EMAILING&gt;</b></font></span><ul><li><font face="arial">A member of the Customer Success team will be reaching out to you shortly to discuss your options for continuing your service and/or extracting your data depending on your decision about the service.</font></li><li><font face="arial">You may keep your Time and Attendance system independently of the Insperity Workforce Optimization relationship, and your Customer Success Specialist will be happy to answer any questions you may have related to keeping Time and Attendance.</font></li></ul><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><b>Insperity Performance Management</b>&nbsp;<font color="#ff6666" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);"><b>&lt;REMOVE THIS SECTION IF CLIENT DOES NOT HAVE PERFORMSMART PRIOR TO EMAILING&gt;</b></font></span><ul><li><font face="arial">A member of the Customer Success team will be reaching out to you shortly to discuss your options for continuing your service and/or extracting your data depending on your decision about the service.</font></li><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;">You may keep your Performance Management system independently of the Insperity Workforce Optimization relationship, and your Customer Success Specialist will be happy to answer any questions you may have related to keeping PerformSmart.</span></li></ul><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><b>Insperity Employment Screening</b>&nbsp;<b><font color="#ff6666" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);">&lt;REMOVE THIS SECTION IF CLIENT DOES NOT HAVE IES PRIOR TO EMAILING&gt;</font></b></span><br><ul><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;">A member of the Customer Success team will be reaching out to you shortly to discuss your options for downloading your background check results.</span></li><li><font face="arial">You may continue your Employment Screening service independently of the Insperity Workforce Optimization relationship. Your account must be transferred to the non-WO screening platform, and pricing may differ. An Insperity Employment Screening representative will be happy to answer any questions you may have related to keeping employment screening.</font></li></ul><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><b>Insperity Recruiting Services</b>&nbsp;<font color="#ff6666" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);"><b>&lt;REMOVE THIS SECTION IF CLIENT DOES NOT HAVE RECRUITING SERVICES PRIOR TO EMAILING&gt;</b></font></span><br><ul><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;">We look forward to continuing to serve your hiring needs. A member of the Customer Success team will be reaching out to you shortly to discuss your options for continuing to utilize the full range of recruiting offerings through Insperity.</span></li><li><font face="arial">Simply execute an updated Service Activation Agreement, which may reflect alternate pricing, to continue your access to your recruiting services team. Our Insperity Recruiting Consultant look forward to answering any questions you may have related to keeping recruiting services.</font></li></ul><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><b>Insperity Talent Connect</b>&nbsp;<font color="#ff6666" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);"><b>&lt;REMOVE THIS SECTION IF CLIENT DOES NOT HAVE TALENT CONNECT (aka APPLICANT TRACKING SYSTEM) PRIOR TO EMAILING&gt;</b></font></span><br><ul><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;">We look forward to continuing to serve your hiring needs. You may keep your Talent Connect system independently of the Insperity Workforce Optimization relationship without interruption of service. Your account can be transferred to the non-WO product offering simply by executing an updated Service&nbsp;</span>Activation Agreement. Members of the Product Team will be happy to answer any questions you may have and will assist you with the transition.</li><li>Talent Connect clients must provide a 30-day notice if they wish to terminate or keep this service. You can do so by sending an email to&nbsp;<a href="mailto:ITCinfo@insperity.com">ITCinfo@insperity.com</a>.</li><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;">A member of the Product Team will be reaching out to you shortly to discuss your options for extracting your data and transition best practices depending on your decision about the service.</span></li></ul><span style="font-size: 12pt;">After leaving the Insperity relationship, there are many employer-related responsibilities you will need to review. Attached you will find a partial checklist of items for your consideration.</span></div><div><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></span></div><div><span style="font-size: 12pt;">We value you and welcome your feedback regarding our partnership and how Insperity might further improve its services. If at any time you feel Insperity's Workforce Optimization<sup>TM</sup>&nbsp; service or any of our standalone Business Performance Solutions may be of interest to you, please don't hesitate to reach out to us.&nbsp;</span></div><div><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></span></div><div><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Kind regards,</span></div><div><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></span></div><div><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><b>Alison R. Entis, PHR, SHRM-CP</b></span><br><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Customer Relationship Manager</span><br><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Customer Relationship Center of Excellence</span></div><div><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></span><span style="font-size: 12pt;">7950 Jones Branch Road | Suite 600 North | McLean, VA 22102</span><br><span style="font-size: 12pt;">OFFICE: 703-821-7335 | MOBILE: 571-296-1211&nbsp;</span><a href="https://www.insperity.com/?elqTrackId=b2f99aec39914b4c90a4df04ece4b25f&elqTrack=true">
<img src= '{!$Label.NSP_Insperity_Business_Logo}'/>
</a></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>